  "notes": "Two things this pins. (a) The M-09 clamp (loop_count <= 20, watched <= duration x (loops + 1)) binds the play_end figure only; a heartbeat stream that already carried 130000 keeps it through GREATEST, so watched_ms here is 130000, not 105000. Recorded, not endorsed: see README. (b) Android divergence 2 (M-12): VideoWatchTracker.accumulateWatched increments loopCount on a wrap and then still applies the forward-jump ceiling to the wrap delta, so a wrap whose tail + head exceeds two ticks (a late sample near the loop boundary) is counted as a loop AND its watch time discarded as a seek: loop_count 20 arrives with a smaller watched_ms_total and a non-zero seek_count. The web tracker skips the ceiling on a wrap."
